  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Major performance improvements - SIMD vectorization, parallel processing, zero-allocation optimizations, color map caching, and ConvertMode-specific fast paths. Speed: +12-70% (Large +48%, XLarge +37%, Ln +70%). Memory: -63% to -99.7%. v1.0.2: Fixed deadlock issues. v1.0.1: Updated README. v1.0.0: Initial release.",
